Ship binaural headphone sound

The binaural package (overlay) installs a service that turns Kodi's 7.1,
played into an ALSA loopback, into headphone sound with CamillaDSP and the
listener's measured speaker responses. It stays inert until the listener
puts a configuration in /storage/.config/binaural.

Signed-off-by: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>

--- a/distributions/CoreELEC/options
+++ b/distributions/CoreELEC/options
@@ -271,4 +271,5 @@
 # Space separated list is supported,
 # e.g. ADDITIONAL_PACKAGES="PACKAGE1 PACKAGE2"
   ADDITIONAL_PACKAGES="u-boot-script dtc CoreELEC-Debug-Scripts inject_bl301 ceemmc
-                       nfs-utils dtb-xml megatools parse-android-dynparts aml_recovery"
+                       nfs-utils dtb-xml megatools parse-android-dynparts aml_recovery
+                       binaural"
